      "writtenOn": "2022-06-15T07:31:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Volume scales are different: HFP 0-15, A2DP/AVRCP 0-127\n\nRelying on existence of addr to decide which profile to use is bad for maintenance IMO.\nSuggest add a new dBus API `set_hfp_volume`. We can validate the volume range for each profile here.",
      "parentUuid": "6134c0fb_cb5a2dc9",
      "revId": "a9debe126f43e0d56ebae58776f4829ddf0eb4cd",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
