      "writtenOn": "2022-06-15T17:16:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agree with both of you. That\u0027s exactly the feedbacks I\u0027d like to get.\n\nIMO, I think eventually it\u0027s better for the bluetooth stack to handle the difference and provide an abstract volume for the audio stack to digest. This will require a well defined media API regarding the volume. I\u0027ll proceeed with adding the set_hfp_volume dedicated for HFP and leave the refinement as a future work.",
      "parentUuid": "89006b8d_28a4bc72",
      "revId": "a9debe126f43e0d56ebae58776f4829ddf0eb4cd",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
